      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Oh, man, Vik'?",
          "rhyme": "ik",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Oh, Vik'—yeah, he's this young cat that",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "He had this thing down pat, he knew what he was doing",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "So, you know, he do his thing",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Younger cat though, good good dude though",
          "rhyme": "O",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Uh, I hear Viktor—Viktor doing somethi’g with, with, uh, with the Insomniac crew",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Yanawha' I mean?",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Ah, shit, I don't really know (?)",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "To me he gone do it, I'd love to hear it though",
          "rhyme": "O",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Vik' is a nasty young MC",
          "rhyme": "ik",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCDEFGHEA",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABCADEAFDA"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "instrumental",
