    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "spoken",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Well, Vik' is, you know, to me his shit is like",
          "rhyme": "Ejk",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Man—how can I describe Vik'?",
          "rhyme": "ik",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Vik'—you know, DOOM come out, DOOM, guy's a rapper, whatever",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "But, Vik'—a lot of people compare DOOM to Vik'—or Vik' to DOOM—vice-versa",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Now the villain everywhere, yo, the Villain is you, the Villain is me, the Villain is you",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "But then Vik', he earns his own rights, you know wha' i'm sayin'?",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "And now he's doing his thing, and he got his own little niche, like people know the difference between the two",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Like I respect that, you can't beat that. Priceless",
          "rhyme": "Es",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCDEFGH",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABCDEFGA"
    }
  ]
